{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>2020年「友誼小姐」鄺美璇於2023年初與圈外金融才俊男友拉埋天窗，今年5月宣布懷孕喜訊。臨盆在即的她，日前於社交平台分享了一段親自佈置BB房的短片，並意外曝光其半山豪宅景觀。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_6e6e6180c7686815-2246\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>片中所見，BB房設計以簡約溫馨為主，擺放了純白色嬰兒床及儲物櫃，櫃內將各式嬰兒衣服、包巾及毛巾分類得精細整齊，足見這位準媽媽心思細密、準備充足。而且，BB房的空間感十足，採光極佳之餘，大型窗戶更可俯瞰半山一片翠綠樹景，視野開揚。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_6e6e6180c7686815-2246\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b0622892-55aa-4950-b534-0303f74f47b8.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026to4tuOLS1P1789439484.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b0622892-55aa-4950-b534-0303f74f47b8.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9cf5befe-c3b5-4933-b7ec-4121e3ae3337.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026KIHHYqbEGd1789439485.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9cf5befe-c3b5-4933-b7ec-4121e3ae3337.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2a431253-e046-4e33-b45c-005ff380bb21.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20268NxRyChX2b1789439484.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2a431253-e046-4e33-b45c-005ff380bb21.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_6e6e6180c7686815-2247\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>畢業於名校英國倫敦政治經濟學院（LSE）的鄺美璇，參選時曾有「翻版廖碧兒」之稱，與同屆三甲謝嘉怡、陳楨怡及郭柏妍感情要好。卸任後，鄺美璇選擇回歸金融本行，婚後不時出埠旅行兼出席高檔晚宴。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T03:00:33.331760+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}